%% TRIP-038 The agent takes the visitor to the payment step
flowchart TD
    A[Resenärer: add-ons and extras asked, never payment] --> B{Traveller form valid?}
    B -- no --> C[show_payment refused: visitor fills in the form]
    C --> A
    B -- yes --> D[show_payment: open the payment page R1]
    D --> E[Ask how to pay, set_payment]
    E --> F[summarise, ask the visitor to check R2]
    F --> G{Payment page, valid form, payment set?}
    G -- yes --> H[Button Boka och betala]
    G -- no --> I[No button]
    H -- pressed --> J[bookCharterAction, as Betala]
